---
import Terminal from './Terminal.astro'
---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-[1180px] px-4 pb-14 pt-6 sm:px-8 lg:pb-24 lg:pt-10">
	<div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.08fr] lg:gap-16">
		<div>
			<h1
				class="font-display text-[clamp(2.8rem,6.4vw,4.4rem)] font-extrabold leading-[0.92] tracking-[-0.035em] text-balance"
			>
				Abre la terminal.<br />No se rompe nada.
			</h1>

			<p class="mt-6 max-w-[44ch] text-[clamp(1.02rem,1.5vw,1.2rem)] leading-relaxed text-tinta/85">
				Empiezas instalando el sistema, en una máquina virtual si prefieres ir sobre seguro, y acabas
				encadenando comandos sin mirar la chuleta.
			</p>

			<div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
				<a
					href="#precio"
					class="rounded-full border-[3px] border-tinta bg-chicle px-7 py-3.5 text-[1.05rem] font-extrabold text-tinta no-underline shadow-[5px_5px_0_var(--color-tinta)] transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:translate-y-0.5"
				>
					Empezar el curso
				</a>
				<a
					href="#ruta"
					class="px-2 py-3.5 text-[1.05rem] font-semibold text-tinta no-underline decoration-uva decoration-[3px] underline-offset-[6px] hover:underline"
				>
					Ver el temario
				</a>
			</div>

			<p class="mt-7 max-w-[38ch] font-mono text-[0.78rem] leading-relaxed text-tinta/70">
				12 semanas. Sin experiencia previa. Da igual si vienes de Windows o de Mac.
			</p>
		</div>

		<Terminal />
	</div>
</section>
